# Generated at runtime — NEVER commit. keys.json holds the issuer's RSA private key and
# certs/ holds the nginx TLS private key. Both are regenerated by setup-certs.sh / the issuer's
# first start. The only credentials this spike commits deliberately are the throwaway
# sm-internal-orgA/orgB basic-auth pairs in provision.sh.
issuer/keys.json
certs/
node_modules/
